    "canvasOnly": true,
    "htmlOverlay": false,
    "domRequired": false,
    "notes": [
      "First-person tropical beach with canvas pointer-look walking, wading and late-afternoon sun.",
      "Six generated seamless albedo tiles are baked to height and normal maps by a JavaScript port of FakeDepthTrick MakeSeamless and BakeRoadMaps.",
      "Hybrid real-time WebGPU/RTX sample, not a full path tracer: WebGPU owns primary visibility, Gerstner water, foam and tiled PBR, while native ray queries add sun visibility, contact shadow, ambient occlusion and reflections.",
      "Displaced water, sky dome and palm fronds are excluded from BLAS construction.",
      "RTX and raster fallback work remains offscreen and shares exactly one tone-mapped swapchain presentation per frame.",
      "Hold the mouse to look, WASD walks, Shift sprints, X compares RTX and raster. Status is stdout only; there is no HTML overlay.",
      "No sample-specific C++, downloaded model or third-party texture library is required at runtime."
    ]
  }
